OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 31 JUL
OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1985FThe BBC announces it has pulled
OL,7,Fthe Real Lives programme, At the Edge
OL,8,Fof the Union, from its BBC One schedule
OL,9,F(for 7th August). The documentary,
OL,10,Fproduced by Vincent Hanna, featured an
OL,11,Finterview with Sinn Fein's Martin
OL,12,FMcGuinness.
OL,13,
OL,14,FThe announcement leads to a one-day
OL,15,Fstrike by members of the National Union
OL,16,Fof Journalists on 7th August. The ban
OL,17,Fwas eventually overturned. A slightly
OL,18,Fedited version of the programme would
OL,19,Fair on 16th October.
OL,20,
OL,21,
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
